  {
   "text": "Seven minutes, or nineteen seconds: which AI would you trust?",
   "start": 0.54,
   "end": 3.88
  },
  {
   "text": "We gave three free AIs the same five coding jobs.",
   "start": 4.52,
   "end": 7.76
  },
  {
   "text": "Gemini's solar system runs, every planet moving.",
   "start": 8.54,
   "end": 11.38
  },
  {
   "text": "The big gpt-oss one never moved.",
   "start": 12.1,
   "end": 14.24
  },
  {
   "text": "Gemini's hexagon had ten balls.",
   "start": 15.1,
   "end": 16.68
  },
  {
   "text": "The small gpt-oss had a hexagon with one ball.",
   "start": 17.28,
   "end": 19.82
  },
  {
   "text": "Gemini took four hundred thirty-four seconds.",
   "start": 20.66,
   "end": 22.6
  },
  {
   "text": "The two gpt-oss models each finished in under twenty seconds.",
   "start": 23.22,
   "end": 26.54
  },
  {
   "text": "Gemini passed five of five, the fast ones four.",
   "start": 27.44,
   "end": 30.13
  },
  {
   "text": "Fast, or finished?",
   "start": 30.68,
   "end": 31.88
  },
  {
   "text": "The full test is on our channel.",
   "start": 32.6,
